<section class="section section--ink" aria-labelledby="s5-title">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="process">
      <div class="process__aside">
        <h2 class="process__title" id="s5-title">Our Digital Identity and Deepfake Testing Process</h2>
        <p class="process__lede">Every engagement is planned with your team and runs under written authorization. We use consenting participants or synthetic personas, and we agree the rules of engagement before any simulation begins.</p>
      </div>

      <ol class="process__list" data-process>
        <li class="step">
          <span class="step__marker" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <h3 class="step__title">Scope and Identity Journey Mapping</h3>
          <p class="step__text">We map the journeys in scope, the channels they use and the decisions that depend on trusting an identity, and agree which scenarios are permitted.</p>
        </li>
        <li class="step">
          <span class="step__marker" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <h3 class="step__title">Threat Modeling and Scenario Design</h3>
          <p class="step__text">We design realistic attack scenarios from the attacker's point of view, combining techniques such as voice cloning, synthetic documents and social engineering.</p>
        </li>
        <li class="step">
          <span class="step__marker" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <h3 class="step__title">Controlled Impersonation Testing</h3>
          <p class="step__text">Under the agreed rules, we run the scenarios against your systems and teams: verification flows, call centers, help desk and approvals. Nothing uses a real person's likeness without written permission.</p>
        </li>
        <li class="step">
          <span class="step__marker" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <h3 class="step__title">Detection and Response Review</h3>
          <p class="step__text">We assess whether your tools and staff noticed the attempts, how alerts were handled and whether the response followed procedure.</p>
        </li>
        <li class="step">
          <span class="step__marker" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <h3 class="step__title">Risk Analysis and Reporting</h3>
          <p class="step__text">Each finding is validated, rated by severity and business impact and written up with evidence. Recommendations combine technical controls and process changes.</p>
        </li>
        <li class="step">
          <span class="step__marker" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <h3 class="step__title">Remediation Support and Retesting</h3>
          <p class="step__text">We walk your team through the findings and support fixes. After changes are made we retest to confirm the same attacks no longer succeed.</p>
        </li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

